134046?s=46&t=ubAzs2LnbXGhsmBbOPS7Rw", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@lightgamein/works/198", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/dea6fd1a/uploads/origins/868012f5-173c-469f-b8b4-f433af779fec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d145af05e9ae2ba511c27cd760c463d1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/dea6fd1a/uploads/origins/868012f5-173c-469f-b8b4-f433af779fec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d145af05e9ae2ba511c27cd760c463d1, https://si.imgix.net/dea6fd1a/uploads/origins/868012f5-173c-469f-b8b4-f433af779fec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b4466163486565e44f34942b9e80274c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/dea6fd1a/uploads/origins/868012f5-173c-469f-b8b4-f433af779fec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2d257098713febfeb32080071691469e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！私のオリジナルキャラクターを描いてほしいです。https://postimg.cc/t1CVS9kx詳細は任せておきます。よろしくお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@lightgamein/works/197", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ad85fc85/uploads/origins/58fef679-cdd8-4943-8fbc-3dae7e82addd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f3928e5f470d6d878ab3ec1cf4946015", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ad85fc85/uploads/origins/58fef679-cdd8-4943-8fbc-3dae7e82addd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f3928e5f470d6d878ab3ec1cf4946015, https://si.imgix.net/ad85fc85/uploads/origins/58fef679-cdd8-4943-8fbc-3dae7e82addd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fda3598f9fdb8121c2d4b03ea556d874 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ad85fc85/uploads/origins/58fef679-cdd8-4943-8fbc-3dae7e82addd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=791ef24478bd4fb9af8367fad2ccb629 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "天坂らいとγ先生はじめま